,title,link,text,language,family
0,Ekoka ǃKung - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ekoka_ǃKung,"Ekoka ǃKung (Ekoka ǃXuun, Ekoka-ǃXû, ǃKung-Ekoka) or Western ǃXuun (North-Central Ju) is a variety of the ǃKung dialect cluster, spoken originally in the area of the central Namibian - Angolan border, west of the Okavango River, but since the Angolan Civil War also in South Africa.",Kung-Ekoka,Kx’a
1,ǃKung languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ǃKung_languages,"ǃKung / ˈkʊŋ / [2][3] KUUNG (ǃXun), also known as Ju (/ ˈdʒuː / JOO), is a dialect continuum (language complex) spoken in Namibia, Botswana, and Angola by the ǃKung people, constituting two or three languages. Together with the ǂʼAmkoe language, ǃKung forms the Kxʼa language family. ǃKung is famous for its many clicks, such as the ǃ in its name, and has some of the most complex ...",Kung-Ekoka,Kx’a
2,GRN !Kung Ekoka - !Kung Ekoka - YouTube,https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL89pq8F3hh1boeeTwaMDWWNylU8iF6I3u,GRN recordings in !Kung Ekoka - !Kung Ekoka These recordings are designed for evangelism and basic Bible teaching to bring the gospel message to people who a...,Kung-Ekoka,Kx’a
3,ǃKung languages — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/ǃKung_languages,"The ǃKung languages, part of the Kx'a family, are spoken by fewer than 20,000 people in total, with the majority concentrated in northern varieties such as Ju|'hoan and Ekoka ǃKung.",Kung-Ekoka,Kx’a
4,YouTube Music,https://music.youtube.com/,"With the YouTube Music app, enjoy over 100 million songs at your fingertips, plus albums, playlists, remixes, music videos, live performances, covers, and hard-to-find music you can't get anywhere else.",Kung-Ekoka,Kx’a
5,Ekoka ǃKung language and alphabet - Omniglot,https://www.omniglot.com/writing/ekokakung.htm,"Ekoka ǃKung Ekoka ǃKung is a Kxʼa language spoken by about 20,000 people in Namibia, Angola and South Africa. In 2013 there were 9,000 speakers of Ekoka !King in Namibia, mainly in the Erongo, Otjozondjupa and Khoma regions. In Angola in 2016 there were 5,500 speakers of Ekoka ǃKung in Cunene, Huíla and Kuando Kubango provinces.",Kung-Ekoka,Kx’a
6,!Kung Ekoka language - globalrecordings.net,https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/knw,"!Kung Ekoka language and dialect information. Audio Bible stories and lessons. Download free evangelism resources, MP3s, audio bible study tools, language/dialect information.",Kung-Ekoka,Kx’a
7,Kung-Ekoka language resources | Joshua Project,https://joshuaproject.net/index.php/languages/knw,Kung-Ekoka language resources. Listing of people groups speaking Kung-Ekoka. Kung-Ekoka dialects and alternate names. Bible and ministry resource availability.,Kung-Ekoka,Kx’a
8,"Ekoka !Kung - Alchetron, The Free Social Encyclopedia",https://alchetron.com/Ekoka-!Kung,"Western !Xuun (North-Central Ju) or Ekoka !Kung (Ekoka !Xuun, Ekoka-!Xû, Kung-Ekoka) is a variety of the !Kung dialect cluster, spoken originally in the area of the central Namibian-Angolan border, west of the Okavango River, but since the Angolan civil war also in South Africa.",Kung-Ekoka,Kx’a
9,Ekoka ǃKung phonology | DevonteSP Wiki | Fandom,https://devontesp.fandom.com/wiki/Ekoka_ǃKung_phonology,"Ekoka has a full set of modal and murmured (breathy) vowels, as well as pharyngealized back vowels, and a reduced set of modal, murmured, and pharyngealized nasal vowels:",Kung-Ekoka,Kx’a
